      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Personally I didn't check it on VRChat world. Based on @suna report, I examined :\n1) Old bundled youtube-dl cann't get video stream URL.\n2) Updated youtube-dl version is latest (2019.01.17)\n3) Updated youtube-dl can get video stream URL with identical argument step 1.\nI execute youtube-dl directly in Windows console.\n\nSuna said replacing youtube-dl fix this issue. But, as jetdog8808 posted, there might be another issue with VRC_SyncVideoStream, but I don't understand that now.",
