      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just to update with more information\n\nThe HLS Stream url thats resolved by the AVProVideo? component for this url https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRlAY486hVg is\n\nhttps://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_playlist/id/PRlAY486hVg.2/itag/96/source/yt_live_broadcast/requiressl/yes/ratebypass/yes/live/1/goi/160/sgoap/gir=yes;itag=140/sgovp/gir=yes;itag=137/hls_chunk_host/r4---sn-htgx20capj-npol.googlevideo.com/playlist_type/DVR/ei/2yjeXNiQE6OT8QP50YuYDA/playlist_duration/30/manifest_duration/30/gcr/sg/initcwndbps/12410/mm/32/mn/sn-htgx20capj-npol/ms/lv/mv/m/pl/24/dover/11/keepalive/yes/mt/1558063217/disable_polymer/true/ip/{{YOUR_IP}}/ipbits/0/expire/1558084923/sparams/ip,ipbits,expire,id,itag,source,requiressl,ratebypass,live,goi,sgoap,sgovp,hls_chunk_host,playlist_type,ei,playlist_duration,manifest_duration,gcr,initcwndbps,mm,mn,ms,mv,pl/signature/05A67155AA686E3991969B6275696A72D0842A13.57191A2F68630E98275CBA8164110F3159B05CF2/key/dg_yt0/playlist/index.m3u8\n\nmy ip address is omitted in the url for obvious reason, this url will not work for you and needs to be generated for everyone but i digress. note the part of the request \"gir=yes;itag=140/sgovp/gir=yes;itag=137\".\n\nusing the latest youtubedl the HLS Stream url that is resolved for the above livestream is https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_playlist/id/PRlAY486hVg.2/itag/96/source/yt_live_broadcast/requiressl/yes/ratebypass/yes/live/1/goi/160/sgoap/gir%3Dyes%3Bitag%3D140/sgovp/gir%3Dyes%3Bitag%3D137/hls_chunk_host/r4---sn-htgx20capj-npol.googlevideo.com/playlist_type/DVR/ei/2yjeXNiQE6OT8QP50YuYDA/playlist_duration/30/manifest_duration/30/gcr/sg/initcwndbps/12410/mm/32/mn/sn-htgx20capj-npol/ms/lv/mv/m/pl/24/dover/11/keepalive/yes/mt/1558063217/disable_polymer/true/ip/{{YOUR_IP}}/ipbits/0/expire/1558084923/sparams/ip,ipbits,expire,id,itag,source,requiressl,ratebypass,live,goi,sgoap,sgovp,hls_chunk_host,playlist_type,ei,playlist_duration,manifest_duration,gcr,initcwndbps,mm,mn,ms,mv,pl/signature/05A67155AA686E3991969B6275696A72D0842A13.57191A2F68630E98275CBA8164110F3159B05CF2/key/dg_yt0/playlist/index.m3u8\n\nwhere the same part of the request is now \"gir%3Dyes%3Bitag%3D140/sgovp/gir%3Dyes%3Bitag%3D137\" where the string has been urlencoded. The former url results in a 403, the latter url works (you will need to generate your own urls to test this as these generated urls are specific to your own ip and expire etc)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
