      "mergedPostDetails": "Since the last youtube-dl update it had been going well, but I think it must be for a few days now that only some of my streams actually work.  i thought before now that it must be my slow connection, combined with network ik, however i've done some testing and there are videos that work just fine.  and others that don't work for me but they do for some people, and then other videos that don't work for others either, which were all fine last week.\n\nit might be that certain isp's are causing this issue, as some do throttle vrchat or amazon servers, hard to get any info out of them.  the log just says it can't play the link, which is a long google hashed link which i could provide if necessary.  \n\nis this happening to any others?",
      "mergedPostTitle": "youtube streams once again unreliable",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
